    "established": {
      "zh": [
        "音视频各有采集、到达和可用时刻，工具另有执行时刻；到达顺序不能替代 event time",
        "不同媒体时钟先映到共同单调轴并保留漂移/不确定度，原始 RTP 时间戳不可跨流直接比较",
        "在线决策只用截止前可用的候选证据，迟到帧不能倒灌已提交工具",
        "历史帧用于解释指代，当前 UI/权限复核才决定动作能否执行"
      ],
      "en": [
        "Audio and video have capture, arrival, and availability times, while tools have execution time; arrival order cannot replace event time",
        "Map media clocks onto a common monotonic axis with drift and uncertainty; raw RTP timestamps cannot be directly compared across streams",
        "Online decisions use only candidate evidence available before the deadline; late frames cannot retroactively justify committed tools",
        "Historical frames explain references, while current UI and authority checks determine whether an action may execute"
      ]
    },
